# SEC-05 history secret scan: the scan, its shared rule set, and the reviewed baseline.
# Without these three lines the CI job's own files are absent from the commit and the job
# fails with "Cannot find module" — the ignore-by-default trap described at the top.
!scripts/secret-rules.mjs
!scripts/history-secret-scan.mjs
!scripts/history-secret-scan.baseline
